propose.ogg"},"스킬":{"voiceline":"어라, 여긴 어디? 하으읏, 적 씨야!","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/301130/skill.ogg"},"터치1":{"voiceline":"후아… 만져지면 잠이 와…","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/301130/touch.ogg"},"터치2":{"voiceline":"우우… 그런 곳 만지면 이상한 느낌…","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/301130/touch2.ogg"},"입수시":{"voiceline":"우,시라츠유급 1번함, 시라츠유… 지휘관 안녕, 시라츠유야─ 에? 방금 말했다고? 우…… 돌아가는 방법 몰라서 여기에 있을 수밖에 없어. 앞으로 잘 부탁해.","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/301130/unlock.ogg"},"강화성공":{"voiceline":"어라…… 지휘관, 여긴 어디? 몸이 따뜻하다……","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/301130/upgrade.ogg"},"vote":null,"승리":{"voiceline":"전 함대, 발포! 어… 어라… 벌써 이겼어?","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/301130/win_mvp.ogg"},"전투개시_ex":null,"상세확인_ex":null,"의뢰 완료_ex":null,"사랑_ex":null,"터치3_ex":null,"모항귀환_ex":null,"hp 경고_ex":null,"로그인_ex":null,"실패_ex":null,"우편_ex":null,"임무_ex":null,"임무완료_ex":null,"스킬_ex":null,"터치1_ex":null,"터치2_ex":null,"입수시_ex":null,"강화성공_ex":null,"승리_ex":null,"함대 특수대사":null,"메인4":null,"메인1_ex":null,"메인5_ex":null,"메인6_ex":null,"메인7_ex":null,"메인8_ex":null,"메인4_ex":null,"메인5":null,"메인6":null,"메인2_ex":null,"메인3_ex":null,"메인9_ex":null,"메인10_ex":null,"메인7":null,"스킨 타입 - 한글":null,"상점 id":0,"상점 카테고리 id":0,"스킨 태그":"X","입수 영상":"X","재화":null,"기간":null,"진영":"IJN","레어도":"R","ex_chat_status":0},{"클뜯 id":301131,"클뜯 함순이 id":30113,"함순이 이름":"시라츠유","한글 함순이 + 스킨 이름":"주문은 어뢰입니까?","영문 함순이 + 스킨 이름":"Is The Order A Torpedo?","스킨 타입":"Maid","전체 일러":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/images/skin/301131/painting.png","확대 일러":null,"sd 일러":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/images/skin/301131/chibi.png","아이콘 일러":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando26